    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/189cdb1520284183989566aa7073149a.poster.avif?t=1753436737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/189cdb1520284183989566aa7073149a.webm?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/189cdb1520284183989566aa7073149a.mp4?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Feign</strong> is a role-playing game with a maximum of 12 players that takes place in a small town where innocents, imposters, and neutrals come together. You use your role at night to win and send a person from the village in the morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/e4d3caee472af946f562ef65b2aa0702.avif?t=1753436737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/68b84023fccf434a0420f34e096a3876.poster.avif?t=1753436737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/68b84023fccf434a0420f34e096a3876.webm?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/68b84023fccf434a0420f34e096a3876.mp4?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Insane is a unique role of Feign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Insane is an innocent role however it is dangerous for the innocents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you have the Insane(innocent) role you don't see that. You think and see that you are some other innocent role. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are Insane(insane), you can think you are an investigator and give wrong information during the whole game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe all the innocents are killed because of you. Can you be... insane?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/c38a5b9f2e1099d10ecfe4261c2e1cab.avif?t=1753436737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/3c7bdeab3e345421e80184081b187678.poster.avif?t=1753436737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/3c7bdeab3e345421e80184081b187678.webm?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/3c7bdeab3e345421e80184081b187678.mp4?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect information at night using your role and try not to die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out who is the imposter in the morning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send people you think are imposters from the village by voting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/542c6ac80a643ecf504216aea4cae0dc.avif?t=1753436737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/fa74f06e233b5bfbc18dcfd0b0f4c12a.poster.avif?t=1753436737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/fa74f06e233b5bfbc18dcfd0b0f4c12a.webm?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/fa74f06e233b5bfbc18dcfd0b0f4c12a.mp4?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill innocents using your role at night or gather information to avoid attracting attention.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try not to be caught by innocents in the morning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/b6b78f1456b39e35a5317fad3315d13c.avif?t=1753436737\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/8a767d592a2402e0ea9b55bace1300c6.poster.avif?t=1753436737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/8a767d592a2402e0ea9b55bace1300c6.webm?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/8a767d592a2402e0ea9b55bace1300c6.mp4?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have your own goals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since your roles are different from other imposter or innocent roles, you may find it difficult to gather information. Therefore, you should keep your eyes open and follow the game well.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Depending on the course of the game, you can fulfill your role by playing against innocents or imposters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This can be killing innocents or imposters, convincing other villagers that you are innocent based on the information you have gathered from other villagers, or directing attention to a person you want. The choice is yours...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/66ed6dd292f82c48a8a84364f554848a.poster.avif?t=1753436737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/66ed6dd292f82c48a8a84364f554848a.webm?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1436990/extras/66ed6dd292f82c48a8a84364f554848a.mp4?t=1753436737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can buy new costumes to dress up your character. You can buy them with the in-game currency of Feign Cookies in the market. You can then dress your character with the clothes in your inventory.</p></li></ul>",
